 //!
 //! The `pathland_gtk_*` C ABI (`capi` module) exposes the same renderer to a
 //! foreign host (Java via JNA): `pathland_gtk_run(host, on_event)` runs GTK
 //! in-process over the `pathland-view-native` host's shared ring.

