Note: the spacers are children of the inner layout, which is a child of the deleted item; deleting the item deletes them. But they are tracked; removing them is fine. Actually, `item->deleteLater()` deletes the subtree; the spacers are children. Calling `deleteLater` on them too is okay (Qt guards). Fine.

